Dialogue: 0,0:00:03.45,0:00:05.90,Default,,0,0,0,,A place in the city\N♪ 在城市一隅 ♪
Dialogue: 0,0:00:06.73,0:00:09.23,Default,,0,0,0,,A chair and a bed\N♪ 一把椅子 一张床 ♪
Dialogue: 0,0:00:10.61,0:00:13.54,Default,,0,0,0,,I cover up all the mirrors\N♪ 遮盖起所有的镜子 ♪
Dialogue: 0,0:00:13.54,0:00:16.46,Default,,0,0,0,,Can't see myself yet\N♪ 仍然还无法面对自己 ♪
Dialogue: 0,0:00:17.44,0:00:20.35,Default,,0,0,0,,I wear smoke like a wedding veil\N♪ 烟雾笼罩 犹如我的婚纱 ♪
Dialogue: 0,0:00:21.48,0:00:24.70,Default,,0,0,0,,Make a meal I won't eat\N♪ 做一顿饭 但我无心享用 ♪
Dialogue: 0,0:00:24.70,0:00:26.82,Default,,0,0,0,,Step out into the street\N♪ 踏入街道 ♪
Dialogue: 0,0:00:26.82,0:00:29.26,Default,,0,0,0,,Alone in a sea\N♪ 仿佛于汪洋之中 孑然一身 ♪
Dialogue: 0,0:00:29.26,0:00:32.11,Default,,0,0,0,,It comes over me\N♪ 那种感觉向我袭来 ♪
Dialogue: 0,0:00:32.60,0:00:34.90,Default,,0,0,0,,Oh, I'm missing you\N♪ 我想你了 ♪
Dialogue: 0,0:00:35.25,0:00:37.88,Default,,0,0,0,,Yeah, I'm missing you\N♪ 没错 我想你了 ♪
Dialogue: 0,0:00:38.23,0:00:40.55,Default,,0,0,0,,And all the things we used to do\N♪ 以及我们过去一起做过的所有事情 ♪
Dialogue: 0,0:00:40.55,0:00:44.20,Default,,0,0,0,,MDMA in the back garden, blow our pupils up\N♪ 在后花园里纵情享乐 瞳孔放大 ♪
Dialogue: 0,0:00:44.20,0:00:46.04,Default,,0,0,0,,We kissed for hours straight\N♪ 我们接吻了数个小时 ♪
Dialogue: 0,0:00:46.04,0:00:48.74,Default,,0,0,0,,Well baby, what was that?\N♪ 好吧 宝贝 那又算什么？ ♪
Dialogue: 0,0:00:48.74,0:00:53.14,Default,,0,0,0,,I remember saying then, this is the best cigarette of my life\N♪ 还记得我当时说 "这是我一生中最棒的一支烟" ♪
Dialogue: 0,0:00:53.14,0:00:55.87,Default,,0,0,0,,Well I want you just like that\N♪ 我渴望那样的你 ♪
Dialogue: 0,0:00:55.87,0:00:59.36,Default,,0,0,0,,Indio haze, we're in a sandstorm and it knocks me out\N♪ 印第奥市的迷雾 我们身处沙尘暴中它将我击倒 ♪
Dialogue: 0,0:00:59.36,0:01:03.04,Default,,0,0,0,,I didn't know then that you'd never be enough\N♪ 彼时我未曾知晓 你永远无法满足我 ♪
Dialogue: 0,0:01:03.04,0:01:06.08,Default,,0,0,0,,Since I was seventeen I gave you everything\N♪ 自从十七岁起 我为你倾尽一切 ♪
Dialogue: 0,0:01:06.08,0:01:10.75,Default,,0,0,0,,Now we wake from a dream, Well baby, what was that?\N♪ 如今我们从幻梦中惊醒 好吧 宝贝 那又算什么？ ♪
Dialogue: 0,0:01:16.70,0:01:19.53,Default,,0,0,0,,What was that?\N♪ 那又算什么？ ♪
Dialogue: 0,0:01:23.45,0:01:25.82,Default,,0,0,0,,Baby, what was that?\N♪ 宝贝 那又算什么？ ♪
Dialogue: 0,0:01:26.25,0:01:28.55,Default,,0,0,0,,Do you know you're still with me\N♪ 你知道吗 你还是如影随形 ♪
Dialogue: 0,0:01:29.95,0:01:32.70,Default,,0,0,0,,When I'm out with my friends?\N♪ 即便我同朋友们在外游玩 ♪
Dialogue: 0,0:01:33.80,0:01:36.73,Default,,0,0,0,,I stare at their painted faces\N♪ 我凝视着那些描摹着妆容的面孔 ♪
Dialogue: 0,0:01:36.73,0:01:40.15,Default,,0,0,0,,They talk current affairs\N♪ 她们谈论时事 ♪
Dialogue: 0,0:01:41.20,0:01:43.35,Default,,0,0,0,,You had to know this was happening\N♪ 你心知肚明这种事情会发生 ♪
Dialogue: 0,0:01:44.84,0:01:47.26,Default,,0,0,0,,You weren't feeling my heat\N♪ 你未曾感受到我的热情 ♪
Dialogue: 0,0:01:47.73,0:01:51.35,Default,,0,0,0,,When I'm in the blue light down at Baby's All Right\N♪ 当我在 "宝贝真好" 俱乐部的蓝光下 ♪
Dialogue: 0,0:01:51.35,0:01:54.85,Default,,0,0,0,,I face reality\N♪ 我直面现实 ♪
Dialogue: 0,0:01:55.48,0:01:59.20,Default,,0,0,0,,I try, to let\N♪ 我尝试，去让 ♪
Dialogue: 0,0:01:59.20,0:02:04.00,Default,,0,0,0,,Whatever has to pass through me pass through\N♪ 让那些需要穿越我的往事就此穿越 ♪
Dialogue: 0,0:02:04.00,0:02:06.50,Default,,0,0,0,,But this is staying a while\N♪ 但这一切仍将停留 ♪
Dialogue: 0,0:02:06.50,0:02:11.93,Default,,0,0,0,,I know It might not let me go\N♪ 我知道它可能不会放过我 ♪
Dialogue: 0,0:02:18.60,0:02:22.13,Default,,0,0,0,,MDMA in the back garden, blow our pupils up\N♪ 在后花园里纵情享乐 瞳孔放大 ♪
Dialogue: 0,0:02:22.58,0:02:25.99,Default,,0,0,0,,We kissed for hours straight, Well, baby, what was that?\N♪ 我们接吻了数个小时 好吧 宝贝 那又算什么？ ♪
Dialogue: 0,0:02:25.99,0:02:31.18,Default,,0,0,0,,I remember saying then, "This is the best cigarette of my life"\N♪ 还记得我当时说 "这是我一生中最棒的一支烟" ♪
Dialogue: 0,0:02:31.18,0:02:34.00,Default,,0,0,0,,Well, I want you just like that\N♪ 我渴望那样的你 ♪
Dialogue: 0,0:02:34.00,0:02:37.50,Default,,0,0,0,,Indio haze, we're in a sandstorm and it knocks me out\N♪ 印第奥市的迷雾 我们身处沙尘暴中它将我击倒 ♪
Dialogue: 0,0:02:37.50,0:02:41.38,Default,,0,0,0,,I didn't know then, but you'd never be enough\N♪ 彼时我未曾知晓 你永远无法满足我 ♪
